{
  "name": "Competitor new pages, weekly email (Webstack Data)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9be882f8-8936-443a-82ab-7291097b5ebf",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 440,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Competitor new pages\nEvery Monday this workflow reads a competitor's sitemaps with the **Sitemap URL Extractor** Actor on Apify and emails you the pages they added or changed in the last 7 days (new products, blog posts, landing pages).\n\n**Setup (5 min)**\n1. Create an *HTTP Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Put the competitor's domain in the JSON body of *Read sitemaps*.\n3. Connect Gmail and set your address in *Email me*.\n\n**Cost:** $0.0003 per URL returned. A site that publishes 50 pages a week costs about $0.06 a month.\n\nOnly works for sites whose sitemaps include `lastmod`, which most CMSs (WordPress, Shopify, Webflow) do."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "69cefc31-653e-45bb-85de-1634f5e614a0",
      "name": "Every Monday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "85901a5f-46da-41d7-9864-3c329d585fe5",
      "name": "Read sitemaps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/uianalize~sitemap-url-extractor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"startUrls\": [\"competitor.com\"],\n  \"modifiedSince\": \"{{ $now.minus({ days: 7 }).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}\",\n  \"maxUrlsPerSite\": 2000\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a5b415ed-a8d2-45df-913a-5febf5ebd752",
      "name": "Only URL rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.type }}",
              "rightValue": "url",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "name": "Build email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst lines = rows.map(r => `${r.lastmod ? r.lastmod.slice(0, 10) : ''}  ${r.url}`);\nreturn [{ json: { subject: `${rows.length} new or updated page(s) on ${rows[0]?.site || 'the competitor site'}`, body: lines.join('\\n') } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "name": "Email me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "you@example.com",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Monday": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read sitemaps",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read sitemaps": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Only URL rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Only URL rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email me",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}